<title>FINLAND: SANTASALO PLANS SHARE AND NOTES ISSUE.</title>
<headline>SANTASALO PLANS SHARE AND NOTES ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering company Santasalo-JOT Oy said on Wednesday that it planned to issue about 600,000 new shares and 75 million markka worth of preferred capital notes to Finnish and international investors.</p>
<p>&quot;Santasalo-JOT decided ... to make preparations for an issue of 600,00 shares and about 75 million markka in preferred capital notes in connection with financing the purchase of the Asko Components business operations,&quot; Santasalo said in a statement.</p>
</text>
